WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:03.330
What I want to do...

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.790
...is make Zushiohmaru my slave.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:11.080
It's the best way to get you to stay with me.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Zushi...

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.410
Stop this game already!

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.830
Once an SCM duel starts,
you cannot stop halfway through.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.370
I ate it all!

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:28.000
This SCM battle is about to get a lot more intense.

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.750
A normal guy wouldn't be able to survive it.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.950
Don't worry, you're definitely not normal.

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:35.370
Thank you.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.410
I can shine brightly with you before me.

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.450
I love you, Eia.

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:55.450
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:07.160
Hajime kara nani mo nozomanakerya

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:14.870
Kono kokoro shizumu koto nai no kana

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:23.750
Aisareru yorokobi nara shitteiru kedo

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:32.330
Monotarinai mitasarenai nayami wa tsukinai

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:38.290
Karakara na kokoro uruoshite kureyo

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:42.080
Afureru hodo yu wo sosoide kure

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:47.660
Munashiku tada hibiku kono sakebigoe

00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:53.870
Taikutsu de arifureteiru mainichi demo

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:57.540
Kono mi ni ataerareta koufuku da to

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:10.000
Itsuwari mo naku waraeru you na kokoro ga hoshii

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:21.500
- awareness-

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:19.580
What are SCMs even supposed to be, Zushi?

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.830
You duel people, make them your slaves,

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:24.290
get made a slave...

00:02:24.870 --> 00:02:28.080
And then what? Stay that way forever?

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:30.330
But why?

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:37.040
Let's give this back, along with the money he gave me.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.200
That idiot!

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.450
Eia...

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:50.660
Why?

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:55.080
Zushiohmaru
Sumida

00:02:56.120 --> 00:02:58.330
My name is Zushiohmaru.

00:02:59.080 --> 00:03:02.330
My master is Eia Arakawa.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.330
I'm heading out, Zushi!

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.750
I'm heading out, Zushi!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:14.410
I lived a happy life with my beloved master Eia.

00:03:17.950 --> 00:03:19.750
Delivery!

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:32.700
I suppose it was love at first sight.

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:36.620
I was head over heels for that bitch before I knew it.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:37.700
Flower
Delivery Service

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.120
Guess this is a man's fate...

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:46.910
I ran after that bitch without a second thought.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:49.500
But...

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:55.120
When I could finally run no more,
I found I'd hurt myself in my passion.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:59.910
What's wrong, boy? You hurt?

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:05.410
Professor Sumida, if we don't hurry,
we'll miss the meeting!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:06.910
Now hold on a minute, Setagaya-kun.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.370
Your name's Zushiohmaru, is it?

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.580
How about it, Zushiohmaru?

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:17.160
Want to stay with me till your wounds heal up?

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.750
I'll make you work, but I won't hurt you.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:29.000
A man named Sumida rescued me,
and soon I was living with him at his workplace.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.040
That's your seat. Be a good boy now, okay?

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:38.620
Sumida was a scientist who was researching the brain.

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:48.540
I owed him a debt for saving my life,
so I decided to help him test the device he was inventing.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:54.040
By using this device to advance my research,
I can go much further than merely training pets.

00:04:54.410 --> 00:05:00.290
I could use it to expand our understanding
of the mammalian reward system and the A-10 nerve!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:57.870
Spine

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:57.870
Peripheral

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:57.870
Nerves

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:58.000
Spinal Cord

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:58.000
Peripheral

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:58.000
Nerves

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:58.330
Spinal Cord

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:58.790
Brain

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
ARACHNOID MATER

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
DURA MATER

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
PIA MATER

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
CORPUS CALLOSUM

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
CEREBELLUM

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
CEREBRUM

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
THALAMUS BRIDGE

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
VENTRICLE

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:00.290
MEDULLA OBLONGATA

00:05:00.540 --> 00:05:03.790
This is the Slave Control Method...

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.660
The SCM.

00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.790
Zushiohmaru, it's me, Setagaya!

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:26.950
Be a good boy for me, just for a little while, okay?

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:37.870
Professor Sumida's a brilliant and passionate researcher,

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.540
but he doesn't know how to apply his talents.

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.370
A device for training pets?

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:48.040
There are much more meaningful,
much more exciting uses for that device.

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.700
Like making people...

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.540
...into slaves.

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.620
The culprit is Setagaya, without a doubt!

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:02.750
He stole the research data!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:04.290
We have to take this to the police!

00:06:04.500 --> 00:06:08.790
Stop! Setagaya is our colleague;
he's worked just as hard as all of us!

00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:12.750
Sumida accepted fault for the incident...

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:15.750
DO
NOT
ENTER

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:15.000
...and left the university.

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.750
SUMIDA

00:06:21.580 --> 00:06:25.580
All I've got is this prototype...

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.040
You want to wear the SCM?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:39.790
The SCM alerts the wearer to other wearers nearby.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:45.250
If I wear the SCM, I might be able to find
the escaped Setagaya.

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:50.040
If I get the research results from Setagaya,
then Sumida will be happy again!

00:06:51.410 --> 00:06:52.580
Going out for a walk?

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:55.830
Alright, alright. Go on out for a bit.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:01.700
That was how I could repay his kindness.

00:07:27.040 --> 00:07:28.700
That's when I decided:

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:35.700
I would forge a new name from the one
I received from Eia and the debt I owed Sumida.

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:44.950
I would live on as Zushiohmaru Sumida.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:48.330
I would find Setagaya and avenge my former master.

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:54.080
How many months passed while I was on my own?

00:07:54.870 --> 00:08:02.000
The SCM in my mouth never responded, leaving me
to battle days of starvation and thirst in silence.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.910
A doggy.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:07.790
It looks kinda sad.

00:08:08.200 --> 00:08:10.000
Maybe it's hungry.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:14.000
Oh, that's it! I took some of my chicken to go.

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.200
Such a kind woman...

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:24.330
I can't give her anything in thanks right now...

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:27.830
But I can at least let her pet my fluffy belly.

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.410
He's got something in his mouth...

00:08:34.370 --> 00:08:38.870
Crap, that was close! If they'd taken out my SCM,
all my work would be for nothing!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:44.790
This buzzing...

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:48.330
Someone wearing an SCM is close by!

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.620
No, it's not Setagaya.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:56.080
The chicken lady is in danger!

00:08:57.910 --> 00:09:00.250
That guy's a bad man!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:02.870
Bring it on!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:07.790
An SCM duel suddenly began.

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.750
Though I didn't get to fight Setagaya,

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:17.000
I did get to reunite with someone
I'd been longing to see for a very long time.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:19.250
My beloved Eia...

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:22.910
But standing next to her was...

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.660
Eia...

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:30.910
Why did you get yourself involved with SCMs?

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:34.410
Why are you worried about that man?

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.910
He's a liar...

00:09:44.000 --> 00:09:45.660
Yuuga Ohta-san?

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.700
Duel me.

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:01.580
I'm the Crazy Person.

00:10:10.160 --> 00:10:13.250
I'm the Crazy Person.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:15.660
You wrote that letter?

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:18.660
Yes. Why didn't you send a reply?

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:21.410
I was so sad, I had to come find you myself.

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.250
So she was watching me...

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:27.950
I can't believe she approached me on a train this packed.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:32.290
The SCM really is the most exciting thing out there...

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:36.250
Yuuga
Ohta

00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:39.500
You felt a little prick on your ass just now, right?

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.700
That was a syringe.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:44.910
It's filled with... well, something dangerous.

00:10:44.910 --> 00:10:47.370
What will you do, Yuuga?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:48.540
Think!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.410
Fine, I'll duel you.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:58.540
Such a good boy.
Let me tell you what the duel is going to be.

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:15.080
I'm sorry, I'm a very cautious woman.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.450
I've already injected you with that drug.

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:24.000
Are you awake?

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:26.290
Yuuga Ohta-san.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:32.830
I am the Crazy Person.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.910
My name is Fujiko Taito.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:41.700
These are my three little pets.

00:11:42.120 --> 00:11:47.330
And their new friend, a cute little doll.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:51.790
I texted her, pretending to be you,
and she came running over.

00:11:52.120 --> 00:11:54.790
Running over to become my slave.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.120
So, Yuuga Ohta-san...

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:02.370
I'm... looking for someone.

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:05.330
I don't know anything about him, not even his name.

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:09.500
But I can picture him perfectly in my mind.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:14.870
Hair just like a lion's mane, a bit tanned, and very tall.

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:15.870
A lion?

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:20.870
And he told me that he was saving up money
to start a business with a friend.

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:28.040
Just curious, did he have a bunch of SCMs
he was planning on selling?

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.870
Yes, that's right.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.620
I believe he had three.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:36.450
I know him. I know that guy really well.

00:12:38.330 --> 00:12:39.450
Tell me.

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.290
Tell me all about him.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.290
Shinnosuke is my friend.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.040
No...

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.120
...he WAS my friend, I guess.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.540
We saved up money to start a business together.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.040
We intended to make a bit of money on the side
by selling SCMS.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:12:59.790
Yo, this shit is crazy, Yuuga!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.700
These SCMS are selling for six million a pop!

00:13:02.700 --> 00:13:06.290
What?! These things? Holy shit...

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:13.120
Shinnosuke wanted to sell the SCMs,
but I saw an opportunity in them,

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:16.290
and in the end, I stabbed him in the back.

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:23.040
I told him it was more exciting than starting a business,
but he told me it was way too scary.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:26.540
You said his name was Shinnosuke?

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.250
Hey, why're you looking for him?

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:33.580
It happened a few months ago.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:37.080
Hey, Sweetheart, come hang with us!

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.750
Wow, Sweetie, you smell real good!

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.580
Knock it off, you two!

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:42.000
The fuck?

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.750
Don't treat a lady like that!

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:50.790
I met him in a tiny corner of a town that never sleeps...

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:53.120
That's when...

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:56.120
I fell for him at first sight.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.870
But in the end...

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:04.870
I DON'T KNOW WHO YOU ARE
BUT IT LOOKS LIKE I GOT
A LITTLE DRUNK AND DRAGGED
YOU TO THIS HOTEL.
I'M REALLY SORRY.

00:14:01.880 --> 00:14:04.870
I DON'T THINK WE HAD SEX OR ANYTHING,
SO I HOPE YOU'LL FORGIVE ME.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:12.370
He left me with the SCM and vanished.

00:14:13.370 --> 00:14:18.660
I thought that if I used the SCM to get slaves,
I'd eventually meet him.

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.950
Then, when I finally saw him again...

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:26.410
...I'd give him my everything!

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:29.410
THAT'S your reason you used the SCM...?

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.410
You don't have to be so rude about it.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:37.750
Are you trying to say there's something
more beautiful in this world than love?

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:41.410
You really are a crazy person.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:46.790
Now then, Yuuga Ohta-san,
it's about time you became my pet.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:52.000
Then you'll tell me everything you know, alright?

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:55.250
I want to know all about him.

00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:58.290
Stop...! I'm not gonna be your slave!

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:01.500
You remember the terms of our duel, yes?

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.790
I'm sorry...

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.750
Eia...!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.500
Am I in my room?

00:15:13.410 --> 00:15:15.330
Yuuga? Are you home?

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:23.040
Whoever sees
their mother first loses.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.040
Yuuga?

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.580
MAMA!

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.580
I'm coming in!

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.450
WELCOME
HOME
MAMA!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.450
I lost.

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:49.500
I fucking lost.

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:54.540
I'm Fujiko Taito's slave!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.950
How did this happen...?

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.910
UNKNOWN
CALLER

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:04.660
Hello?

00:16:05.450 --> 00:16:09.160
Yuuga Ohta, this is an order from your master.

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:14.330
She gave me two orders over the phone.

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:19.870
One, meet up at a specified location
to capture Eia and Zushiohmaru.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:24.580
Two, ignore all of Eia's calls and texts.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.870
Eia Arakawa

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.330
Nobody's here.

00:16:44.450 --> 00:16:47.120
Wh-what?! What's happening?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:49.910
You're going to duel me.
If you try to run, I'll kill you.

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.410
You're going to duel me.
If you try to run, I'll kill you.

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:54.750
Who are you?

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:56.250
The duel will be Rock Paper Scissors.
I'll throw Rock. You throw Scissors.

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:59.250
The duel will be Rock Paper Scissors.
I'll throw Rock. You throw Scissors.

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:06.040
O-okay, we're going to play rock-paper-scissors,
I'll throw scissors and lose, is that good?

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.620
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.620
H-huh?

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:21.040
Why didn't you throw scissors
like you were supposed to?

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:25.120
B-because I'm a bit of a contrarian, I guess.

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:26.540
I figured.

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:31.040
I knew you wouldn't throw scissors.

00:17:33.750 --> 00:17:36.040
Eia?! How...

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.700
You got what you deserved, losing to that crazy person.

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:49.200
Zushi and I were really pissed at you.
We didn't think we had any reason to save you.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.200
But I did promise.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:54.200
Remember?

00:17:55.660 --> 00:18:00.450
If you lost to someone,
I'd put on the SCM and get you back.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.450
I kept my promise.

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:08.450
You put on the SCM... just to save me?

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:15.080
Eia... Zushiohmaru...

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:18.290
I'm sorry. It's all my fault...

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:27.080
I won't let you suffer anymore, you idiot.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:35.660
As soon as I lost to Crazy Person, I tried to call you.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.950
I didn't know if you understood, though...

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:43.750
I'm surprised you had the balls to beg for help
from someone you lied to before.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.700
I can't deny that.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:49.620
You left a long message on my phone
that sounded like you were on a train.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:55.080
If you needed me you'd have blown into it,
and it seemed like you were in a really bad situation.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:59.750
So I used an untraceable phone to call you up,
and here we are.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:03.370
Eia, you hate SCMs.

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.790
Are you going to step away from the game
now that you saved me?

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.450
No.

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:10.950
I'm going to use this SCM a little while longer.

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:12.250
I've changed my mind.

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:12.790
Huh?

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.790
I think I'll get myself some slaves, too.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:22.290
KABUKI-CHO ICHIBAN-MACHI

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:40.700
Don't struggle.

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.250
It'll only get worse for you.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:46.620
Duel me.

00:19:56.620 --> 00:19:58.620
After I became Eia's slave,

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:05.620
Eia used the map to find a girl named Sachi Shibuya
and forced her into becoming her slave.

00:20:05.910 --> 00:20:07.620
Who's your master?

00:20:12.330 --> 00:20:15.000
Takio Minato...

00:20:15.790 --> 00:20:20.200
I had no right to blame her, but...

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:26.000
She was supposed to hate SCMs,
and now she was using one so aggressively.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:30.540
Maybe the SCM really was created by the Devil himself.

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.160
Please...

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.540
Don't look at me like that, Zushi. Not you too.

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:44.410
Ever since you were enslaved, Zushi, I've been thinking...

00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:50.700
Thinking of a way to free us from the SCMs.

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:55.750
Well, his master just has to release him from slavery.

00:20:56.200 --> 00:20:57.330
No.

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:00.250
Then you and Zushi are the only ones who are free.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:02.250
That's not right.

00:21:02.910 --> 00:21:04.330
What about Ayaka-san?

00:21:04.330 --> 00:21:06.250
What'll happen to Seiya?

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.910
What if there's someone out there
in an even worse situation?

00:21:11.160 --> 00:21:14.120
Ryuuou, Fujiko Taito...

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:15.790
We don't know who we'll be up against.

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.620
But...

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:21.200
I don't want anyone else to fall victim to these SCMs.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:29.290
I'm going to enslave everyone wearing an SCM,
then let them all go free.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:34.250
Then I'll rid the world of SCMs.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:37.040
Eia, you're...

00:21:38.120 --> 00:21:41.040
Well? Am I trying too hard to seem cool?

00:21:42.290 --> 00:21:44.040
Will you help me?

00:21:44.370 --> 00:21:46.290
I mean, you're going to help me!

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:47.790
That's an order.

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:51.790
Fine. I can't disobey you, anyway.

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:22.000
-awareness-

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:28.660
Kyuukyoku no game kokoro o tamesareteru

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:33.450
Ichi tai ichi kara hajimaru kakehiki wa

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:36.120
Girigiri ni miete osu ka hiku ka setogiwa no koubou

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:37.910
Girigiri ni miete osu ka hiku ka setogiwa no koubou

00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:41.040
Nee dochira ga yuusei

00:22:41.040 --> 00:22:45.290
Kachime no nai rule demo ii

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:51.500
Te no hira ni wa saki no mienai one chance

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:56.660
Me no mae no deck wa mirai terashiteru?

00:22:57.330 --> 00:23:06.250
Omote to ura no kaoiro ukagau fuserareta unmei

00:23:06.250 --> 00:23:11.410
Un o hikiyosete make nante mitakunai

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:15.160
Nainai bakari ja shinka dekinai

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:19.790
Kimi no kake ni uchikatte

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:27.620
Kabe o koeteyuke nido to bust shinai tame ni

00:23:37.410 --> 00:23:42.410
-servitude-
